flowchart TB
    accTitle: From an observation to a reviewed sharing decision
    accDescr: Research starts with sourced observations, accessible context and an assessment. Delivery then curates the relevant records, checks each resource's audience and makes an explicit export or publication decision.
    subgraph Research["Research"]
        direction LR
        A["Preserve observations<br/>Events · attributes · objects"] --> B["Investigate context<br/>Values · workspace · graph"] --> C["Record an assessment<br/>Notes · opinions · relationships"]
    end
    subgraph Delivery["Delivery review"]
        direction LR
        D["Curate a useful result<br/>Report · collection · selection"] --> E["Review each audience<br/>Ownership · scope · attachments"] --> F["Choose delivery<br/>Export or publish · verify receipt"]
    end
    Research --> Delivery
